comments.grounded:
Every claim is grounded. The Invite and Roles sections support:
- team members on the Pro plan, up to 5;
- the path Settings › Team › Invite;
- entering the email and picking a role;
- the Member role being able to create and send invoices and manage clients;
- the 7-day invitation expiry.

The statement that Members can't access billing or ownership settings is a reasonable reading of the Roles section. Even Admins are excluded from billing and ownership, and Members have only the listed abilities.

The two £15 charges on 2 November come from the sender's own account, which is acceptable. The refund wording follows 'Who decides a refund': the billing team reviews every request, and the assistant explicitly makes no promise. No outcome is promised.
